<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %><%@ taglib prefix="fmt" uri="jakarta.tags.fmt" %><fmt:setLocale value="vi_VN"/>
<layout:page title="Thẻ kho" view="inventory/card" bodyClass="app-page" css="mvp" bare="false">
<jsp:body>
<main class="page-body app-content catalog-page"><div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Thẻ kho · <c:out value="${cardHeader.sku}"/> — <c:out value="${cardHeader.name}"/></h1><p>Kho <c:out value="${cardHeader.warehouse_name}"/> · <c:out value="${cardHeader.address}"/> · Đơn vị cơ sở: <c:out value="${cardHeader.base_unit}"/></p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/inventory/stock?warehouse=${cardHeader.warehouse_id}">Tồn kho</a></div><section class="content-panel padded-panel"><form method="get" class="mvp-filter"><input type="hidden" name="warehouse" value="${cardHeader.warehouse_id}"><input type="hidden" name="product" value="${cardHeader.product_id}"><label class="field">Từ ngày<input type="date" name="from" value="<c:out value='${param.from}'/>"></label><label class="field">Đến ngày<input type="date" name="to" value="<c:out value='${param.to}'/>"></label><ui:button variant="secondary">Lọc thẻ kho</ui:button></form><p>Số tồn gồm cả phát sinh trước khoảng ngày đang xem.</p></section><section class="content-panel padded-panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Thời điểm</th><th>Phát sinh</th><th>Lô</th><th>Tăng / giảm</th><th>Tồn SKU theo sổ</th><th>Tồn lô sau phát sinh</th><th>Chứng từ</th><th>Người ghi</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${events}" var="event"><tr><td><c:out value="${event.occurred_at}"/></td><td><c:out value="${event.event_label}"/></td><td><c:out value="${event.lot_code}"/></td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${event.quantity_delta}" pattern="+#,##0.############;-#,##0.############"/></td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${event.warehouse_balance}" pattern="#,##0.############"/></td><td><fmt:formatNumber value="${event.on_hand_after}" pattern="#,##0.############"/></td><td><c:choose><c:when test="${not empty event.receipt_id}"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/inventory/receipts?id=${event.receipt_id}">PN-${event.receipt_id}</a></c:when><c:when test="${not empty event.shipment_id and access.allows('FULFILLMENT_READ')}"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/fulfillment/shipments?id=${event.shipment_id}">PX-${event.shipment_id}</a></c:when><c:when test="${not empty event.recovery_shipment_id and access.allows('FULFILLMENT_READ')}"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/fulfillment/shipments?id=${event.recovery_shipment_id}">Nhận về · PX-${event.recovery_shipment_id}</a></c:when><c:when test="${not empty event.return_id and access.allows('RETURN_READ')}"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/accounting/returns?id=${event.return_id}">Trả hàng · ${event.return_id}</a></c:when><c:otherwise><c:out value="${event.source_id}"/></c:otherwise></c:choose></td><td><c:out value="${event.actor_name}"/></td></tr></c:forEach><c:if test="${empty events}"><tr><td colspan="8">Chưa có phát sinh kho.</td></tr></c:if></tbody></table></div><p>Tồn SKU cộng dồn theo thứ tự thời điểm và ID phát sinh; chứng từ nguồn giữ lịch sử từng lô.</p></section></main>
</jsp:body>
</layout:page>
